"diagnosis": "MR imaging demonstrates a crescent-shaped extra-axial fluid collection over the left cerebral hemisphere, measuring up to 1.8 cm in maximal depth. This collection exhibits heterogeneous signal intensity, with areas of high T1 signal representing subacute blood products mixed with more chronic hypointense components. There is moderate mass effect, resulting in effacement of the left cortical sulci and a 5 mm shift of midline structures to the right.\n\nImpression: Left-sided chronic to subacute subdural hematoma with significant mass effect and mild midline shift. Urgent neurosurgical consultation is recommended to evaluate for evacuation."
