"diagnosis": "Brain MR demonstrates a well-circumscribed, extra-axial mass arising from the left frontal convexity, measuring approximately 2.6 x 2.4 x 2.2 cm. The mass is iso- to hypointense on T1-weighted sequences, hyperintense on T2, and shows homogeneous, intense contrast enhancement with a prominent dural tail sign. There is mild mass effect on the adjacent frontal lobe parenchyma with minimal surrounding vasogenic edema.\n\nNo other intracranial abnormalities are identified. Impression: Solitary extra-axial mass at the left frontal convexity, most consistent with a benign dural-based meningioma. Recommend outpatient neurosurgical follow-up."
