"diagnosis": "Brain MRI reveals a well-circumscribed, extra-axial dural-based mass located along the anterior sagittal sinus, measuring approximately 3.2 x 2.8 x 2.5 cm. The mass is isointense to grey matter on T1 and T2 sequences and demonstrates intense, homogeneous enhancement following gadolinium administration, including a prominent dural tail sign. There is mild compression of the adjacent superior frontal gyrus and a thin rim of surrounding vasogenic edema.\n\nImpression: Well-circumscribed extra-axial dural-based mass along the anterior sagittal sinus, characteristic of a benign meningioma. There is mild mass effect on the adjacent frontal lobe without significant midline shift."
