"diagnosis": "Brain MRI demonstrates a crescent-shaped extra-axial fluid collection along the right frontoparietal convexity, measuring up to 1.4 cm in maximal depth. The collection displays heterogeneous signal on T1 and T2-weighted images, consistent with a chronic subdural hematoma with acute-on-chronic hemorrhage. There is associated mass effect, with compression of the right lateral ventricle and 5 mm of leftward midline shift.\n\nImpression: Right frontoparietal chronic subdural hematoma with evidence of recent re-bleeding (acute-on-chronic subdural hematoma) and moderate mass effect on adjacent structures."
