"diagnosis": "MRI demonstrates severe dilation of the left ventricle with an end-diastolic volume index of 145 mL/m2. Diffuse global hypokinesis of the left ventricular myocardium is present. Late gadolinium enhancement imaging demonstrates a thin, linear band of mid-wall hyperenhancement in the mid-septal segment, suggesting a non-ischemic pattern of myocardial fibrosis.\n\nImpression: Severe non-ischemic dilated cardiomyopathy. Left ventricular systolic function is severely depressed with a calculated ejection fraction of 28%."
